                "date": "2018-12-07",
                "text": "No enters-the-battlefield abilities of the land Thespian's Stage is copying will trigger. Thespian's Stage was already on the battlefield. Similarly, no \"as this land enters the battlefield\" or \"this land enters the battlefield with\" effects, such as that of Dark Depths, will apply."
            }
        ]
    },
